 secretary of state this year, we may never have a fair presidential election in this country again. And if Arizona elected Republican senator this year, that senator will surely vote to overturn the results of the Electoral College in Congress if the Republican loses the Electoral College.\par \par \uc2 All of those candidates running statewide in Arizona will work to legally guarantee that Arizona`s 11 electoral votes always go to the Republican candidate for president.\par \par \uc2 The Australian immigrant to the United States, \uc2 Rupert Murdoch\uc2 , is the most poisonous billionaire ever to infect our politics. \uc2 Rupert Murdoch\uc2  pays his people at Fox to churn out propaganda to destroy democracy in America. The latest effort includes what we call a documentary about the Republican candidate for Senate in Arizona, Blake Masters, who has never held public office and has worked in the field of venture capitalism.\par \par \uc2 Here he is in that so-called documentary, taking his orders from \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 DONALD TRUMP\uc2 , FORMER PRESIDENT (through telephone): You got a lot of support.\par \par \uc2 BLAKE MASTERS (R), ARIZONA SENATE CANDIDATE: Absolutely, we stay with those people.\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2  (through telephone): If they say, how is your family? She says the election was rigged and stolen. You`ll lose if you go soft. You`re going to lose that base.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 O`DONNELL: Donald Trump`s candidate for the Senate in Arizona began the campaign saying \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  won the 2020 presidential election. Then, when pulling indicated that most voters strongly disagree with that, Blake Masters tried to shift to what \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  calls a softer position and lying about that election.\par \par \uc2 And \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  puts the ideal candidate, his Republican candidate for governor of Arizona, Kari Lake, who lies every single day she breathes about the 2020 presidential election. If Kari Lake is governor of Arizona, and Blake Masters is Arizona`s Republican senator, they will do everything they possibly can every single day to prevent Arizona`s electoral votes, 11 electoral votes from ever going to a Democrat, no matter how many votes the Democrat may get in the state of Arizona, and that could mean that the voters of New York, or Massachusetts, or California, or Illinois, or any other state or denied the power of their own votes if their votes combined with the votes of other states deliver enough Electoral College votes to elect a Democrat to the presidency.\par \par \uc2 [22:10:02]\par \par \uc2 Because Arizona could steal that election if the margin was that close. Arizona could steal the election from the rest of the country by illegitimately delivering and its electoral votes to the Republican. In that scenario, the governor of Arizona and the secretary of state of Arizona and the Republican senator of Arizona will have stolen democracy from every other state in the Union. They will have stolen it from you.\par \par \uc2 Standing between these Republican candidates and the theft of your voting power, wherever you live in this country, or two candidates who will join us tonight, Arizona Senator Mark Kelly, running for reelection, and Arizona Secretary of State \uc2 Katie Hobbs\uc2 , now the Democratic nominee for governor.\par \par \uc2 When I worked in the Senate, I noticed something about the people for whom being a senator was not the most difficult thing they had ever done in their lives. They were the wounded were heroes, like Republican \uc2 Bob Dole\uc2 , and Democrats \uc2 Bob Kerrey\uc2 , and \uc2 John Kerry\uc2 . There was John Glenn, who is a navy pilot through combat missions in World War II and the Korean War. And then became the first astronaut to orbit the Earth.\par \par \uc2 And then there was Princeton Rhodes scholar Bill Bradley who won two \uc2 NBA\uc2  championships with the 